{"id": 20651, "title": "My bedroom", "level": "Intermediate", "hsk_tags": ["HSK3"], "slug": "my-bedroom", "audio_url": "/audio/mandarin/20651_my-bedroom.mp3", "simplified_paragraphs": ["我的卧室很小， 但是我很喜欢。 卧室中间有一张大床， 床边有一张书桌， 书桌前放着一把椅子。 床的另一边放着一个衣柜和一个书架。 书架上都是我最喜欢的书， 每天晚上坐在窗前看书是我最幸福的时候。 卧室的墙是绿色的， 窗帘也是绿色的， 那是我最喜欢的颜色。 书桌上有我的画和花， 真是太美了。"], "traditional_paragraphs": ["我的臥室很小， 但是我很喜歡。 臥室中間有一張大床， 床邊有一張書桌， 書桌前放著一把椅子。 床的另一邊放著一個衣櫃和一個書架。 書架上都是我最喜歡的書， 每天晚上坐在窗前看書是我最幸福的時候。 臥室的牆是綠色的， 窗簾也是綠色的， 那是我最喜歡的顏色。 書桌上有我的畫和花， 真是太美了。"], "pinyin_paragraphs": ["wǒ de wò shì hěn xiǎo，  dàn shì wǒ hěn xǐ huan。  wò shì zhōng jiān yǒu yī zhāng dà chuáng，  chuáng biān yǒu yī zhāng shū zhuō，  shū zhuō qián fàng zhe yī bǎ yǐ zi。  chuáng de lìng yī biān fàng zhe yī gè yī guì hé yī gè shū jià。  shū jià shàng dōu shì wǒ zuì xǐ huan de shū，  měi tiān wǎn shang zuò zài chuāng qián kàn shū shì wǒ zuì xìng fú de shí hou。  wò shì de qiáng shì lǜ sè de，  chuāng lián yě shì lǜ sè de，  nà shì wǒ zuì xǐ huan de yán sè。  shū zhuō shàng yǒu wǒ de huà hé huā，  zhēn shì tài měi le。"], "english_paragraphs": ["My bedroom is small, but I like it very much. There is a large bed in the middle of the bedroom, a desk beside the bed, and a chair in front of the desk. On the other side of the bed is a wardrobe and bookshelf. The bookshelf is filled with my favorite books. Sitting in front of the window and reading every night is my happiest time. The bedroom walls are green and the curtains are green. That's my favorite color. There are my paintings and flowers on the desk. They are so beautiful."], "english_full": "My bedroom is small, but I like it very much. There is a large bed in the middle of the bedroom, a desk beside the bed, and a chair in front of the desk. On the other side of the bed is a wardrobe and bookshelf. The bookshelf is filled with my favorite books. Sitting in front of the window and reading every night is my happiest time. The bedroom walls are green and the curtains are green. That's my favorite color. The